<title>USA: Indonesian investor raises YES! stake.</title>
<headline>Indonesian investor raises YES! stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian investor Andyla Yasa of Jakarta said Wednesday he raised his stake in YES! Entertainment Corp. to 1,389,502 common shares, or 9.32 percent of the total outstanding, from 1,201,002 shares, or 8.01 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Yasa said he bought 188,500 Yes! shares between Jan. 15 and Feb. 27 at prices ranging from $5.925 to $6.425 a share.</p>
